/E (Leading the paradigm shift from on-premise capabilities to cloud services, Amazon's AWS segment is setting the stage for a pivotal revolution in the AI landscape. Commanding a dominant 31% of the global cloud market, AWS is not just a player but a trendsetter, pioneering the shift from traditional on-premise data centers to more dynamic, scalable cloud solutions. Their arsenal? The largest array of GPUs in the cloud domain and the fastest service refresh cycles, ensure they stay ahead of the rapidly evolving technological demands.)
