/S /P
/P 682 0 R
/E (The White House Blueprint for an AI Bill of Rights, introduced by the Office of Science and Technology Policy \(OSTP\), outlines five key principles to guide the design, use, and deployment of AI systems, including safe and effective systems, algorithmic discrimination protections, data privacy, notice and explanation, and human alternatives, consideration, and fallback.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [9]
>>
